Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ri.  N.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:46.00,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1527,472)\pos(376.889,301.333)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:54.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:56.66,main,Rin,0,0,0,,There's the shrine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.14,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Come on, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:02.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Get the shrine, not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.99,0:02:08.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:11.65,main,Rin,0,0,0,,How was that, Megu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:14.90,main,Megu,0,0,0,,I was embarrassed recording it, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:18.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But I wanted to go on this date with Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:21.24,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Except it's not a date, \Nit's an extracurricular project.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:22.91,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:26.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,At least let me pretend, Megu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:31.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We won't even get to go \Non the same class trip, y'know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:32.41,main,Megu,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:35.73,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Plus, Senpai's gonna graduate first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:41.12,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Quit going into a downward \Nspiral over some homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:43.95,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:49.73,main,Megu,0,0,0,,For today, you can think of \Nme as your senpai, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:56.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai doesn't call me Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:02:59.97,main,Megu,0,0,0,,I stepped in it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.53,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wish he would!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.93,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Don't cry, now. I'll buy you some dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:08.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wanna eat them with Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.38,main - top,Megu,0,0,0,,How can you be so annoying \Nand cute at the same time...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:29.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What is this? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:34.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We got into kind of a... \Nweird mood, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:38.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,All right, who's the creep \Nwho made you cry, Nanakura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's you, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.96,0:04:09.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura, club's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:13.54,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Still sleepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:16.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She sleeps like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.73,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:24.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What do you want for dinner, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.62,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.97,0:04:29.49,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That'll give you indigestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:32.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Y'know what, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:36.66,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is she really sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:47.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:49.26,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:53.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura, you were saying "I like \Nyou Senpai" a bunch in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:02.44,sign_7158_46_Playing_Dumb_,SFX,0,0,0,,{\fs22\move(490,92,-25,93,28,3907)\clip(m -5 148 l -1 109 2 59 -2 141 112 144 115 65 242 46 291 146 441 136 433 33 207 11 -3 38 -11 136)}Playing Dumb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:03.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:12.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:18.17,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, this is the thing they were talking \Nabout on the internet. They say it's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:18.42,sign_7509_50_Goya_Drink,Label sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEDF8FA&\4c&H40B085&\b1\i1\frz48.91\pos(356,92)\frx352\fry10}Goya Drink
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:20.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yep. We found it the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:24.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Did a little "Make it look like you're \Nenjoying it" contest and everybody lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:27.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I would love for you to give it a try, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I am kind of curious about the taste...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:43.25,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Huh. It's better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:47.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you serious?! You drank \Nit like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:56.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What is this flavor?! It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:06:00.33,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, that was acting just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:04.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Damn, actors can really \Npull off some wild stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:08.14,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't think I'd be \Nable to do another take.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I never wanna drink this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This would be an an indirect kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh my, this is so embarrassing! \NYou have to drink the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.85,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Don't try and pawn it off on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's not it, honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:26.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I mean, come on, think of \Nthe indirect kiss... y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:31.87,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I w-w-want \Nto give you an indirect kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:34.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You mean Tsundere-chan drank some too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:37.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This changes everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:41.79,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Not satisfied with it being indirect?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:45.63,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Imp-chan had some too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.55,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,There sure is a lot left, \Nif that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:51.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well, it is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.39,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Y'know, for actors...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You guys must be really bored \Nif you don't have any stage time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:05.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,They do say that waiting is part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.54,0:07:12.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Apple!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Shiritori, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:22.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,"Apple of my eye, I have to focus on my club \Nactivities, instead of of being with you."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:25.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura. "You."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:28.05,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We're gonna play using only \Nromantic-sounding statements.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You... You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:39.71,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"You're not supposed to spend time \Nwith girls other than me."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:46.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That was scary! I got chills!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,"Me? Are you sure I'm the one you want?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:52.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That was just like a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:55.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe I should've let you have that one...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:57.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"Want..."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:08:00.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"Want me to look after you, \Nif you're not feeling well?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:04.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's kinda like a line a guy would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:08.36,main,SFX,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear it from you, someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:10.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can look after you if—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:11.77,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't mean right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:16.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,"Well, I like you, Nanakura."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,M-M—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:34.42,main - top,Rin,0,0,0,,Me too! Me too! Me too me too me too! {repeat as necessary}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:34.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Uh, you're supposed to \Nstart with "you!" You!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.63,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're good at winking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:50.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you have \Ntrouble with it, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:02.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Your mouth is open...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.11,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I really can't pull it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe think of it as acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:11.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're Imp-chan, and someone just caught \Nyou skipping class in the nurse's office!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:16.66,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone you saw me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:22.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Your mouth is way open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:28.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Let me see yours again \Nfor reference, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:30.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:35.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't stare too hard, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:41.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you look too close... you'll fall for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:43.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.46,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, I hate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.41,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H4A4D3F&\fs16\frz346\pos(315,209)\frx12\fry28}Nurse's Office
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.19,0:10:00.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.29,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I got hurt during P.E...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:08.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,No one's around...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:13.42,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:16.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nurse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:18.93,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:20.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I fell...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:24.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's just a scrape, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:28.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I saw you go into the nurse's \Noffice and... I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.58,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're here to finish me off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:30.88,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:34.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The nurse does seem to be out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:35.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to handle it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:37.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We've got all the tools, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,And... that is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:50.58,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:53.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You definitely look a little bit smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:55.69,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Only a little?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:00.69,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Here, let's get that disinfected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:03.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're gonna take care of it? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:04.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You think it's gonna sting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:07.01,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It looks so painful...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:10.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nice and gentle please. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:13.71,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Promise you won't get mad\Neven if it does hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:18.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What is this?! I'm being healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:20.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That obviously isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:25.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I bet a demure nurse would be very gentle...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:29.04,main,Demure Rin,0,0,0,,You're a big boy, so you \Ncan hang in there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:31.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hell yeah! Hit me with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That doesn't sting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:47.17,main,Rin,0,0,0,,There. All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:49.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:52.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'm actually hurt here, too..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:57.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Nurse? You're bright red.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:02.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That is not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:05.27,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You might need an eye exam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:08.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.83,sign_17457_155_Ni,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(288,44)\fnVerdana\fs22}Ni
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:09.83,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What does this say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:10.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Tsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.71,sign_17550_158_Ni______________,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(226,57)}Ni                          Ha {open on the top circle}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:17.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,N. De. Re.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:18.21,sign_17610_160_Ri______________,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(210,38)}Ri                 Sa               Na {open on left side then right side circles}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You just wanted to say tsundere...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:25.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I do feel like my eyesight's \Ngotten worse, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:28.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Tsundere-chan, what kind of glasses \Ndo you think I'd look good in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:34.48,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,How should I know?! \NWhy are you even asking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:39.50,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, you seem the most likely \Nto give me a serious answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:42.48,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,If I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:46.14,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can't even look at you directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:48.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You've really mastered those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:52.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do this seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:13:00.23,sign_17610_160_Ri______________,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,Ku                                  N {circle open on bottom}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:13:00.23,sign_17610_160_Ri______________,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(216,185)}Ri                 Sa                 Na
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:13:00.23,sign_17610_160_Ri______________,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(217,294)}I                  Ku                  To
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:13:01.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Na. Na. Ku. Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:01.51,sign_17610_160_Ri______________,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(213,237)}To                      Ma                      Ra
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:03.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What happened to taking it seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And that was a guess at the end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:08.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I couldn't actually read that "Ra."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:11.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:13.27,sign_17610_160_Ri______________,Zoom in sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,129)}Ri                 Sa                Na
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:18.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ri N... Ri N...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:20.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:27.11,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ri.. N...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:30.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You literally just did it again, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:38.92,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(520.556,347.556)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:43.92,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(129.556,131.556)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo\N {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:43.92,sign_19661_188_This_was__a_bad_,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(861,1)\b1\frz12.56\pos(513,154)}This was \Na bad \Nidea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:13:59.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:00.81,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That new dungeon is too tough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wanna do co-op?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:07.39,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sure! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:09.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What kinda team comp should we use?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I guess I'll focus on debuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.58,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Curse-style, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:20.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That sounds like a team Imp-chan would use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:26.34,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,But you're the one who bewitched me, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:29.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I-I might get distracted, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:32.05,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Be ready to rez me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:33.68,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.87,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,This dungeon is too tough to \Nbeat without taking it seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:46.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wow, Nanakura, you're pretty hardcore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:50.85,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I wanted to play with you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:53.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can't focus at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:02.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Aw— What—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:05.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:08.88,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd be that distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:09.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This time we're gonna \Nbeat it so I can go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.97,0:15:23.15,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Then why don't you show me your moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:28.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Please stop acting, Nanakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:37.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Can you see your house from here, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:40.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:42.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How about yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:45.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's over there. But you \Ncan't see it at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:55.88,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd like to go to Senpai's house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:16:00.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I bet Tsundere-chan lives in \Nthat high-rise apartment building.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:02.63,main,Rin,0,0,0,,She's rich?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:06.02,main,Rin,0,0,0,,She's a tsundere, so naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:08.21,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wonder where Cool-chan lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:12.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:15.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Looks like she's from \Na distinguished family!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:16.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,A real princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:19.53,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What kind of house would \Nyou like to live in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:23.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.50,main,Eiji/Rin,0,0,0,,- The one with the blue roof—\N- The one with the blue roof—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:31.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! We picked the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:34.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then again, I was first, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:36.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It was at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:41.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe... we could live there together...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.67,main,Eiji/Rin,0,0,0,,- Dibs on the second floor—\N- Dibs on the second floor—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:48.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Same room too, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:09.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Something about rain gets me hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:13.09,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I hate it when my socks get soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:16.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I realize this isn't a great time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:20.49,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be super cute if \NCool-chan was scared of thunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:23.35,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:26.28,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,I'm not really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:32.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What're you doing? \NYou don't have to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.42,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You put the idea in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then just ignore my nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:42.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I can't deny that I'd like \Nto see Imp-chan acting scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:47.23,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Protect me for now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:49.51,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't play with your umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:56.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That one was kinda close, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:17:59.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm scared...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.67,0:18:04.33,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You wanna hang out at my \Nplace until the rain lets up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:07.61,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:15.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you... actually scared or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:16.37,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sure am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:23.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, we're soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:29.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We sure are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:32.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You want a change of clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That way your uniform can dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:50.65,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Not only am I at his house, \NI'm wearing his clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.87,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,We're basically dating \Nat this point, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:19:00.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,When you're done changing, \Nyou can hang out in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:02.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Or the living room, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.24,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'll go to your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:16.32,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai's room...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:23.55,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,It's Senpai's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:27.08,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,His room, his room, his room, his room!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:26.64,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:31.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,When my mom gets home, \Nshe's gonna insist on you eating with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:33.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is it okay if you're \Nlate heading home today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.76,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Wearing matching outfits...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.28,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,And meeting his parents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:44.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think I'll change back into my uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.56,0:19:46.78,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Uh, it's definitely not dry yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:48.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,B-But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:51.01,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:52.77,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:58.18,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But... but this is... wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:02.74,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,Have we got company?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:09.27,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-It's nice to meet you. \NMy name is Nanakura Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:12.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is my kouhai from Drama. \NShe's waiting out the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.82,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:31.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It was very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.57,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,Be careful on your way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:37.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Right. Thanks for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:40.13,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,Come visit again, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,S-Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:50.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wish I could've stayed longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:54.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You really hit it off with Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:57.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She was calling you Rin-chan and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:04.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:11.74,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I want you to call me Rin, too, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:31.38,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You can come by whenever you want... Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:39.21,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, this is really embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:42.26,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're actually blushing, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:45.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So are you, Nanakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.02,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Rin! It's Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:49.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Fine, Rin Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:50.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's how a foreigner would say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:52.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin Nanakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:27.88,sign_33852_355_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(324.2,94.2)\3c&H4767A6&}Much Ado About Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:27.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, you're too much! Much... \NMuch Ado About Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:31.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I've got an idea for \Nthe place I'd like to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.51,0:23:35.88,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It'd have a really comfortable living room,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:38.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,with a lot of space, \N warm decor, and a big window...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.59,0:23:40.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That sounds girly, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:44.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,A house where the married couple can relax \Nand the children can be lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:47.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I guess this backdrop won't cut it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:50.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Obviously not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.07,0:23:52.07,main,,0,0,0,,
